s of the turn's start. A change still owed wakes you for your next turn.\", \"read_at\": 1795682919.816, \"role\": \"figtab-repo\", \"turn_started_at\": 1795682852.807}, \"turn_limits\": {\"job_seconds\": 14400.0, \"no_progress_seconds\": 1800.0, \"seconds\": 7200.0}, \"work\": {\"awaited\": [{\"number\": 12, \"owner\": \"paper-repo\", \"pull_request\": false}], \"changes\": [{\"branch\": \"dev\", \"commit\": \"59621b70682c752ae7d17872655246c99089299c\", \"from\": \"paper-repo\", \"kind\": \"push\", \"repository\": \"paper-repo\", \"subjects\": [\"paper: Arena control blocks are random; SE ratio at most 0.92 under the other departures; pairs among replicates used; control used 8 null simulations\"]}, {\"commit\": \"532f793e01513a10045a48c5316acc9854b073e2\", \"kind\": \"push\", \"repository\": \"paper-repo\", \"subjects\": [\"Merge pull request 'Version 1: the paper on dev' (#10) from candidate-v1 into main\", \"paper: Arena control blocks are random; SE ratio at most 0.92 under the other departures; pairs among replicates used; control used 8 null simulations\", \"paper: search-table caption names the tiny MT-Bench subproblem counts\", \"REPRODUCE: Arena control blocks are random\", \"paper: first-order rescaling constant is fitted on the other datasets\", \"paper: trims to hold nine pages after the figure resize\", \"paper: positive control reported (Delta does not respond to the departures tried; SE ratio does), Arena flip offset, appendix table, abstract kept within 230 wo\", \"figures: type >= 6 pt in every figure (plain log ticks, no small scripts, Fig. 4 drawn at its included width); Table 3 search labels fit one line\", \"positive_control.csv: MT-Bench human complete, Arena-55k cells partial\", \"paper: scope of rando\n[truncated for publication]", "exit": null}}}, {"id": "9f44e7f3-4700-5465-bd8b-5847135b9721", "at": 1795682919.3120906, "clock": "host", "stream": "runner", "sequence": 79765, "layer": "worker", "category": "usage", "kind": "session.usage", "r